@startuml RF19_Sequencia
title RF19 — Interagir socialmente com esquemas e peças: reagir, comentar, salvar, compartilhar, remixar e retornar\nDiagrama de sequência — endpoints reais
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Pessoa" as U
participant "Frontend\ncomponents/interactions.tsx" as FE
participant "SocialController" as SC
participant "CommentController" as CC
participant "SocialService" as S
participant "SchemeService" as SS
participant "NotificationService" as N
participant "CounterStorePort" as CT
participant "HypeSignalRecorder\n+ HypeIntegrityPolicy\n<<RF49>>" as HR
database "MySQL" as DB
note over FE, SS : novo (RF49 · HypeScore v2): GET /api/schemes/{id} e GET /api/pieces/{id} por pessoa logada que não é dona\npublicam HypeSignal LOOK_VIEWED (SchemeService) / PIECE_VIEWED (WardrobeService)
U -> FE: curtir
FE -> SC: POST /api/interactions/{type}/{id}/reactions {reaction: LIKE}
SC -> S: react(user, type, id, LIKE)
S -> S: target(): visibilidade, bloqueio, moderação
S -> DB: SELECT reactions (actor, target, reactionType)
alt já reagiu
  S -> DB: DELETE reactions · likeCount-1
  S --> FE: 200 {active:false, count}
else nova reação
  S -> DB: INSERT reactions · likeCount+1
  S -> CT: increment("scheme"|"piece", id, "likes")
  S -> N: notify(owner, NEW_LIKE | NEW_REACTION)
  N -> DB: INSERT notifications (delivered = tipo habilitado)
  opt reaction == LIKE
    S ->> HR: publishEvent HypeSignal(LIKE_CREATED)
  end
  S --> FE: 200 {active:true, reaction, count}
end
U -> FE: comentar
FE -> SC: POST /api/interactions/{type}/{id}/comments {content, parentId}
SC -> S: comment(user, type, id, content, parentId)
alt vazio / > 500 / ofensivo
  S --> FE: 400 COMENTARIO_VAZIO | COMENTARIO_LONGO | CONTEUDO_BLOQUEADO
else válido
  S -> DB: INSERT comments (active=true) · commentCount+1
  S -> N: notify(owner, NEW_COMMENT)
  S ->> HR: publishEvent HypeSignal(COMMENT_CREATED)
  S --> FE: 201 {id, author, content, createdAt}
end
U -> FE: excluir comentário
FE -> CC: DELETE /api/comments/{commentId}
CC -> S: deleteComment(user, commentId)
alt não é autor nem dono do conteúdo
  S --> FE: 403 (Guard.deny, auditado)
else permitido
  S -> DB: UPDATE comments SET active=false · commentCount-1
  S --> FE: 204
end
U -> FE: salvar
FE -> SC: POST /api/interactions/{type}/{id}/saves
SC -> S: toggleSave(user, type, id)
S -> DB: INSERT | DELETE saved_items
opt INSERT (salvou)
  S ->> HR: publishEvent HypeSignal(SAVE_CREATED)
end
S --> FE: 200 {saved}
note right of S: PUT .../saves/favorite (favorite = true)\n→ HypeSignal(FAVORITE_CREATED) <<RF49>>
U -> FE: compartilhar (FEED ou EXTERNAL)
FE -> SC: POST /api/interactions/{type}/{id}/shares {channel, caption}
SC -> S: share(user, type, id, channel, caption)
opt channel == EXTERNAL e type == SCHEME
  S -> SS: renderCard(user, id, expanded=true)
  S -> S: MediaService.put("shares/{user}/…png")
end
S -> DB: INSERT shares · shareCount+1
S ->> HR: publishEvent HypeSignal(SHARE_CREATED)
S -> N: notify(owner, NEW_REACTION, {channel})
S --> FE: 200 {shareId, channel, shares, imageUrl?, link?}
U -> FE: remixar
FE -> SC: POST /api/interactions/{type}/{id}/remixes
SC -> S: remix(user, type, id)
alt type == SCHEME
  S -> SS: remix(user, id)
  SS -> DB: SELECT scheme_items da origem · peças elegíveis do remixador
  SS --> FE: 201 {prefill(origin REMIX, remixedFromId), missingPieces, next:/create-look?remix=}
  note right of SS: ao salvar o remix (POST /api/schemes → SchemeService.create\ncom originalScheme): HypeSignal(LOOK_REMIXED) <<RF49>>
else type == PIECE
  S ->> HR: publishEvent HypeSignal(PIECE_REMIXED)
  S -> N: notify(owner, NEW_REMIX)
  S --> FE: 201 {next:/create-look?seedPiece=, sourcePiece}
end
U -> FE: retornar (a partir da peça)
FE -> CC: POST /api/pieces/{pieceId}/return-to-origin?fromScheme={id}
CC -> S: returnToOrigin(user, pieceId, fromScheme)
S -> DB: SELECT scheme_items WHERE wardrobe_item_id (esquemas visíveis, mais antigo primeiro)
S --> FE: 200 {originSchemeId, title, otherSchemes}

== HypeScore v2: gravação do sinal (novo · RF49) ==
note over HR : @TransactionalEventListener(AFTER_COMMIT) onSignal\n→ SideEffectRunner (REQUIRES_NEW): falha aqui nunca desfaz a interação
HR -> HR: HypeIntegrityPolicy.weight(sinal, dia)
alt visitante (sem ator) · ator == dono (exceto PIECE_USED / PIECE_IN_LOOK / LOOK_WORN)\n· chave hype:dedupe:{sinal}:{entidade}:{ator}:{dia} já existe (TTL 26 h)
  HR -> HR: peso 0 — sinal descartado
else conta criada há menos de 7 dias
  HR -> DB: HypeSignalDailyRepository.increment(peso 0,5)\nINSERT … ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE hype_signal_daily
else demais
  HR -> DB: HypeSignalDailyRepository.increment(peso 1)\nINSERT … ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE hype_signal_daily
end
@enduml
